WEBVTT

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:31.763
and how much they shower
their children with love.

00:06:32.163 --> 00:06:34.297
You would think that would matter enough

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.830
to make children growing up
in the same home more alike

00:06:37.863 --> 00:06:40.030
than if they had been raised apart.

00:06:40.063 --> 00:06:41.263
But it doesn't.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:44.730
In 2015, a meta analysis,

00:06:44.763 --> 00:06:46.463
a study of studies,

00:06:46.497 --> 00:06:49.630
found this pattern across
thousands of studies

00:06:49.663 --> 00:06:54.497
following over 14 million twin pairs
across 39 countries.

00:06:55.263 --> 00:06:58.563
They measured over 17,000 outcomes.

00:06:58.597 --> 00:07:00.363
And the researchers concluded